IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ho voglia di provare cibi che non
riesco a trovare qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ecco perché ho deciso di traslocare.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}So che non te l'aspettavi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma ormai
ho deciso: me ne andrò il giorno {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}}
di questo mese!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Addio, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0008:0000:1100000015000000}}
Ti prego, rimani!
Tanti saluti e baci!

EN:
Hey, so you know how travel is kind
of a sophisticated hobby?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I don't wanna be a little kid forever,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
so {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've decided to move to a new
town on the {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} of next month!{{TAG:0008:0000:1100000015000000}}
Please don't leave me!
Take care!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Alle sagen, dass ich noch zu klein
